[{:db/id "q-11972/selection/cc524c47031d34896618fcc53a7b1e9d2f594657e2e141138b68f7aee9f5c635" :answer/id #uuid "ed9e9a04-9e65-51ee-812f-cfb87c57edfa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972/selection/e384928f1f872fb53b9d7ff4ebc695d875b426d1b6f49efdaee51cd2a10a5cf1" :answer/id #uuid "ae7d025c-fe6d-519b-806f-355da3ca5d56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{7}{10}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972/selection/ae7168b4eb92520a351920678e69683b5854e3ff839e092fa53c732fce2bd095" :answer/id #uuid "12cf0e3d-820a-5c9c-b73a-6e0ec70ba8d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972/selection/ca5a43f46fac688a0ff51ff171ec13ceeba0b85068f3d7bc7ef8118a9c337d30" :answer/id #uuid "5754939e-dbec-587b-8981-d4821d47ca8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{7}{10}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972/selection/1bb8cf0c2bce28f70962930070916f5281677ebd17c5782e93faa95761ccc736" :answer/id #uuid "2bcd7fe9-bbce-56c8-8b94-23719607f35f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{7}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c2e3fa2-9857-5f2e-92c6-3a8c28e14e44" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-11972/selection/ca5a43f46fac688a0ff51ff171ec13ceeba0b85068f3d7bc7ef8118a9c337d30" :answer-field/choices ["q-11972/selection/cc524c47031d34896618fcc53a7b1e9d2f594657e2e141138b68f7aee9f5c635" "q-11972/selection/e384928f1f872fb53b9d7ff4ebc695d875b426d1b6f49efdaee51cd2a10a5cf1" "q-11972/selection/ae7168b4eb92520a351920678e69683b5854e3ff839e092fa53c732fce2bd095" "q-11972/selection/ca5a43f46fac688a0ff51ff171ec13ceeba0b85068f3d7bc7ef8118a9c337d30" "q-11972/selection/1bb8cf0c2bce28f70962930070916f5281677ebd17c5782e93faa95761ccc736"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-11972" :question/id #uuid "c41ad31a-6e3e-586e-8ef8-be80c0201af2" :question/math-academy-id "q-11972" :question/problem "The vector $v$ in the plane is mapped to the vector $[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ whose matrix $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat is the original vector $v?$" :question/worked-solution "From the given information, we have \n\n$$\nT\\cdot v=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWe need to reverse the action of the matrix $T.$ So, we multiply the above equation by ${T}^{-1},$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1}\\cdot T\\cdot v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we need to calculate the inverse of $T$, which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{2-(-8)}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the original vector is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{7}{10}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-11972/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d4daa6bc-1c9a-5c23-8032-4d70435d9388"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-11972"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-276283/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e002377188