- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "From the given information, we have \n\n$$\nT\\cdot v=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWe need to reverse the action of the matrix $T.$ So, we multiply the above equation by ${T}^{-1},$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1}\\cdot T\\cdot v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we need to calculate the inverse of $T$, which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{20-16}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the original vector is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={T}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-276283/field-1" "q-276283/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d4daa6bc-1c9a-5c23-8032-4d70435d9388"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-276283"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-85171/selection/2abc78f7808485d66e1af0c4afa164d186ae9695fc4e445022e90dab89030120" :answer/id #uuid "8c7728da-afa3-5b21-9819-8db41f35140c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85171/selection/89a7b50043145b047ec0b49f3140fd1e1b3e4de0bc9d81a9f50ac0b4c1e9f136" :answer/id #uuid "63031ba3-d181-50b5-81f9-e5df67880862" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85171/selection/316e31382540e65d0f46665a667fc04a682c6856ba5ccfe153e9